=3Deasier to read?). But the order doesn't really matter logically.
=C2=A0
{lo patfu be la maks} is a description and a constant in the sense that it =
keeps the same reference for some stretch of the discourse.=C2=A0 The relat=
ion between constants of the description sort and quantifiers is complex an=
